Day 8 - Standardized API Error Handling & Error Codes

Enterprise Financial Data Platform | Java 21 | Spring Boot 4.1.1

1. Objective

Standardize failure responses across Customer Service and Account Service before adding more microservices. The goal was to give clients a predictable error contract containing a stable error code, message, timestamp, request path, and the correct HTTP status.

2. Architecture

