Consistent HTTP error response

3. Shared Error Contract

Created in platform-common:

com.financialplatform.common.exception.ErrorCode - centralized technical/API error codes.

com.financialplatform.common.exception.ErrorResponse - shared failure response record.

Successful endpoints continue to use ApiResponse; ErrorResponse is dedicated to failures.

public record ErrorResponse(
    boolean success,
    String errorCode,
    String message,
    LocalDateTime timestamp,
    String path
) {}

