10. Interview Explanation

We standardized API failures across microservices by moving a shared ErrorCode enum and ErrorResponse contract into platform-common. Each service keeps its own domain exceptions and maps them through @RestControllerAdvice to the appropriate HTTP status and stable error code. This gives frontend and downstream consumers a predictable contract while keeping service-specific business logic isolated.